  "AI Assistant Terms & Important Information": "AI 助手条款和重要信息",
  "Before using the AI Assistant, please review the following important information:": "在使用 AI 助手之前，请查看以下重要信息:",
  "Usage Costs": "使用成本",
  "Using AI providers may incur charges based on your usage. These costs are billed directly by the AI provider (OpenAI, Anthropic, etc.) and are not covered by Headlamp.": "使用 AI 提供商可能会产生基于使用量的费用。这些费用由 AI 提供商(OpenAI、Anthropic 等)直接计费，Headlamp 不承担。",
  "API Keys": "API 密钥",
  "You will need to provide your own API keys from AI providers. These keys are stored locally in your browser and are not transmitted to Headlamp servers.": "你需要提供来自 AI 提供商的 API 密钥。这些密钥本地存储在浏览器中，不会传输到 Headlamp 服务器。",
  "Data Privacy": "数据隐私",
  "Your queries and cluster information will be sent to the selected AI provider for processing. Please review your AI provider's privacy policy and ensure you comply with your organization's data policies.": "查询和群集信息将发送到所选 AI 提供商进行处理。请查看 AI 提供商的隐私策略，并确保遵守组织的数据策略。",
  "Responsibility": "责任",
  "You are responsible for monitoring your usage, managing costs, and ensuring compliance with your organization's policies when using AI features.": "你负责监视使用情况、管理成本，并确保在使用 AI 功能时符合组织的策略。",
  "Important Reminder": "重要提醒",
  "Always verify AI-generated suggestions before applying them to your Kubernetes clusters, especially in production environments. The AI Assistant is a tool to help you, but you remain responsible for all actions taken.": "始终验证 AI 生成的建议，然后再将其应用到 Kubernetes 群集，尤其是在生产环境中。AI 助手是一种帮助你的工具，但你仍对采取的所有操作负责。",
